1. Intensity → reps
   - Levels are now 0.5 / 0.75 / 1.0 / 1.25 / 1.5 (was 0.6–1.4): 10 reps → 13
     on "hård", 15 on "max"; rest scales inversely (60 s → 48 s).
   - Workout overview rescales every row live with readiness/intensity:
     "3 × 13 (10)" in the accent colour, resolved rest per exercise.
     Readiness + intensity controls moved above the overview.

2. Involved voice coaching (Coach.ts / script.ts)
   - Greets by name, intro merged into one utterance.
   - Technique cues after every 3rd rep in the first half (rotating through
     exercise.instructions.coachCues), tempo words ("ner") on slow lifts,
     scheduled on the engine clock so they pause with the session.
   - "Halvvägs!" + praise, second-half pushes (sometimes personal), "Två
     kvar!", "Sista!", varied praise, "<övning> klart.", "Ett set kvar." /
     "Nästa övning: …", rest talk, "Sista setet. Ge allt!", last exercise,
     block/round announcements, hold + breathing cues on timed holds.
   - Intensity changes explain their effect: "Intensitet: hård. Vi ökar.
     13 repetitioner nu."  Short sets (< 6 reps) stay clean.
   - New VoiceSettings techniqueCues / tempoCues with toggles in Settings.

3. Exercise instructions
   - ExerciseInstructions (steps, mistakes, coachCues, tempo) on all 30
     exercises, sv + en.
   - Tap any exercise in the overview → ExerciseSheet (bottom sheet) with
     this workout's prescription, key cue, numbered steps, common mistakes,
     coach cues, tempo and muscle chips.

4. Card colours
   - Palette: red, orange, yellow, lime, cyan, violet, magenta with
     main/deep/soft + contrast-safe "on" text colour; onAccent() helper.
   - Each built-in program has its own colour; WorkoutCard wash + badge,
     start button, history stripes and chips follow it.

5. Custom workouts
   - CustomWorkoutDraft (flat: name, goal, level, accent, exercises with
     sets · reps-or-seconds · rest, transition) compiled by compileDraft()
     into a regular Workout so engine/coach/metrics need no changes.
     draftFromWorkout() flattens any program for "Kopiera & anpassa".
   - CustomWorkoutRepository (AsyncStorage, pulsecoach:v1:customWorkouts),
     customWorkoutStore, findWorkout()/useWorkout() for built-in + custom.
   - /builder/[id] route: WorkoutBuilderScreen (name, colour, goal, level,
     steppers, reps↔time, reorder, remove, info, validation, save, delete)
     + ExercisePicker (search + category). Library: "Mina pass" section +
     "Skapa eget pass". Detail: copy on all, edit/delete on custom.
   - Card forwards testID when not pressable.

Tests 56 → 84 (Coach.test rewritten, customWorkout.test, theme.test, four
new e2e flows). tsc + eslint clean. README updated throughout.

